      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ansted%2C_West_Virginia"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Ansted had railroad service from 1874 until 1972, including a narrow-gauge line built by mine owners in 1874.",
